{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "每次从当前有序区间选择中间元素作为根节点，再递归处理左右两段。中点把元素尽量均匀地分到两侧，因此生成的二叉搜索树保持高度平衡。动画使用示例 nums = [-10,-3,0,5,9]，依次展示区间拆分与节点加入过程。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>将有序数组转换为平衡二叉搜索树</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body{\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #1c1c1c;\n    color: #d4d4d4;\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  main{ width: 100%; padding: 28px clamp(18px, 5vw, 64px) 40px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; color: #fff; font-size: 22px; }\n  .summary { margin: 0 0 24px; color: #b9c1c9; }\n  .panel {\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    border: 1px solid #3b3b3b;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background: #252526;\n  }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 14px; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }\n  .array { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }\n  .cell {\n    min-width: 72px;\n    padding: 8px;\n    border: 1px solid #555;\n    border-radius: 7px;\n    background: #2d2d30;\n    text-align: center;\n    transition: background .35s, border-color .35s, color .35s;\n  }\n  .cell.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .cell.mid { background: #0e639c; border: 2px solid #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .num, .range, .node, .formula { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .num { font-size: 17px; }\n  .index { margin-top: 4px; color: #9da5b4; font-size: 13px; }\n  .cell.active .index, .cell.mid .index { color: #fff; }\n  .status {\n    min-height: 78px;\n    padding: 14px 16px;\n    border-left: 4px solid #3794ff;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    background: #2d2d30;\n  }\n  .status strong { color: #3794ff; }\n  .formula { margin-top: 5px; color: #c5e1ff; }\n  .tree-wrap { overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 6px; }\n  .tree {\n    min-width: 620px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(8, minmax(56px, 1fr));\n    grid-template-rows: auto 36px auto 36px auto;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .node {\n    justify-self: center;\n    min-width: 54px;\n    padding: 10px 8px;\n    border: 2px solid #555;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #2d2d30;\n    color: #777;\n    text-align: center;\n    transition: background .35s, border-color .35s, color .35s;\n  }\n  .node.visible { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .edge {\n    align-self: stretch;\n    justify-self: center;\n    width: 2px;\n    background: #555;\n    opacity: .3;\n    transform-origin: top;\n    transition: background .35s, opacity .35s;\n  }\n  .edge.visible { background: #3794ff; opacity: 1; }\n  .root { grid-column: 4 / 6; grid-row: 1; }\n  .e1 { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 2; transform: rotate(35deg); }\n  .e2 { grid-column: 6; grid-row: 2; transform: rotate(-35deg); }\n  .left { grid-column: 2 / 4; grid-row: 3; }\n  .right { grid-column: 6 / 8; grid-row: 3; }\n  .e3 { grid-column: 1 / 3; grid-row: 4; transform: rotate(35deg); }\n  .e4 { grid-column: 5 / 7; grid-row: 4; transform: rotate(35deg); }\n  .ll { grid-column: 1 / 3; grid-row: 5; }\n  .rl { grid-column: 5 / 7; grid-row: 5; }\n  .legend { margin-top: 16px; color: #9da5b4; font-size: 13px; }\n  .complexity { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }\n  .badge { padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; background: #2d2d30; }\n  .badge b { color: #3794ff; }\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}main{padding:8px 10px 10px!important;max-width:560px!important;margin:0 auto!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}.summary{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.panel{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-bottom:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.cell{min-width:38px!important;padding:4px 6px!important;border-radius:4px!important;border-width:1px!important}.num{font-size:13px!important}.index{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.status{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;min-height:auto!important;font-size:12px!important}.tree{min-width:0!important;min-height:auto!important}.node{min-width:36px!important;padding:4px!important;font-size:12px!important;border-width:1px!important}.badge{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:11px!important}.legend{font-size:10px!important;margin-top:8px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>从中点开始，递归构造平衡 BST</h1>\n  <p class=\"summary\">有序数组保证：中点左侧都更小，中点右侧都更大。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">示例数组</div>\n    <div class=\"array\" id=\"array\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">当前步骤</div>\n    <div class=\"status\" id=\"status\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">逐步生成的树</div>\n    <div class=\"tree-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"tree\">\n        <div class=\"node root\" data-node=\"0\">0</div>\n        <div class=\"edge e1\" data-edge=\"left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"edge e2\" data-edge=\"right\"></div>\n        <div class=\"node left\" data-node=\"-3\">-3</div>\n        <div class=\"node right\" data-node=\"9\">9</div>\n        <div class=\"edge e3\" data-edge=\"ll\"></div>\n        <div class=\"edge e4\" data-edge=\"rl\"></div>\n        <div class=\"node ll\" data-node=\"-10\">-10</div>\n        <div class=\"node rl\" data-node=\"5\">5</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"legend\">每个亮起的节点，都是其所在子数组的中间元素。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel complexity\">\n    <div class=\"badge\">时间复杂度 <b class=\"formula\">O(n)</b></div>\n    <div class=\"badge\">递归栈 <b class=\"formula\">O(log n)</b></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const nums = [-10, -3, 0, 5, 9];\n  const array = document.getElementById('array');\n  const status = document.getElementById('status');\n\n  nums.forEach((value, index) => {\n    const cell = document.createElement('div');\n    cell.className = 'cell';\n    cell.dataset.index = index;\n    cell.innerHTML = `<div class=\"num\">${value}</div><div class=\"index\">下标 ${index}</div>`;\n    array.appendChild(cell);\n  });\n\n  const steps = [\n    { l: 0, r: 4, m: 2, nodes: ['0'], edges: [], text: '处理整个区间，选择中点 0 作为根节点。' },\n    { l: 0, r: 1, m: 1, nodes: ['0','-3'], edges: ['left'], text: '递归处理左半段，选择 -3 作为 0 的左孩子。' },\n    { l: 0, r: 0, m: 0, nodes: ['0','-3','-10'], edges: ['left','ll'], text: '区间只剩 -10，它成为 -3 的左孩子。' },\n    { l: 3, r: 4, m: 4, nodes: ['0','-3','-10','9'], edges: ['left','ll','right'], text: '递归处理右半段，选择 9 作为 0 的右孩子。' },\n    { l: 3, r: 3, m: 3, nodes: ['0','-3','-10','9','5'], edges: ['left','ll','right','rl'], text: '区间只剩 5，它成为 9 的左孩子，构造完成。' },\n    { l: -1, r: -1, m: -1, nodes: ['0','-3','-10','9','5'], edges: ['left','ll','right','rl'], text: '每个节点左右子树的高度差不超过 1，得到平衡二叉搜索树。' }\n  ];\n\n  function render(step) {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.cell').forEach(cell => {\n      const i = Number(cell.dataset.index);\n      cell.classList.toggle('active', i >= step.l && i <= step.r);\n      cell.classList.toggle('mid', i === step.m);\n    });\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-node]').forEach(node => {\n      node.classList.toggle('visible', step.nodes.includes(node.dataset.node));\n    });\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-edge]').forEach(edge => {\n      edge.classList.toggle('visible', step.edges.includes(edge.dataset.edge));\n    });\n    const range = step.l >= 0 ? `[${step.l}, ${step.r}]` : '全部区间';\n    const formula = step.m >= 0 ? `mid = ⌈(${step.l} + ${step.r}) / 2⌉ = ${step.m} (偶数区间取右中点)` : '构造结果：[0, -3, 9, -10, null, 5]';\n    status.innerHTML = `<strong>区间 ${range}</strong><div>${step.text}</div><div class=\"formula\">${formula}</div>`;\n  }\n\n  let current = 0;\n  render(steps[current]);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    current = (current + 1) % steps.length;\n    render(steps[current]);\n  }, 2200);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
